node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# Local incremental-build state. Docker's context is filesystem-, not git-, aware, so a
# stale tsbuildinfo on disk (gitignored, but still a real file) travels into the image even
# though **/dist above is excluded -- tsc then believes the (missing) dist is already
# up to date and emits nothing, and the runtime image ends up with no dist/index.js at all.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
design
docs
*.md
.env
.env.*
